%% AirDash boot sequence — what happens between tap-to-open and dashboard painted
%% Renders natively on github.com via mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Phone user
  participant SW as Service Worker<br/>airdash-v11
  participant CF as Cloudflare Pages
  participant FN as Pages Function<br/>/api/[[path]].js
  participant T as Cloudflare Tunnel
  participant M as AirDash Mac<br/>(Node :8341)
  participant DB as SQLite<br/>(4,887 stations)

  U->>SW: Tap bookmark or type URL
  Note over SW: NETWORK-FIRST for navigations
  SW->>CF: GET / (navigation)
  CF-->>SW: 200 OK · index.html
  Note over SW: skipWaiting + clients.claim
  SW-->>U: HTML · starts parse

  U->>CF: import('/js/main.js?v=…')
  CF-->>U: 16 KB main.js

  U->>CF: import('./panels/*.js', …)
  Note over U: ~30 module imports,<br/>all 15-30 KB each
  CF-->>U: parallel fetches (gzip)

  U->>U: HTML parsed → boot screen
  U->>U: T+0.1s: paint chrome, initMap, initHeader,<br/>initRanking, initDetail, etc.
  U->>U: T+0.4s: all panels bound to listeners

  U->>CF: GET /api/snapshot
  CF->>FN: proxy /api/snapshot
  FN->>T: HTTPS over tunnel
  T->>M: fetch http://localhost:8341/api/snapshot
  M->>DB: SELECT readings + risk + danger
  DB-->>M: 779 KB raw JSON
  M-->>T: response (gzip → 93 KB)
  T-->>FN: response
  FN-->>CF: response
  CF-->>U: 93 KB gzipped
  U->>U: T+1.4s: parse JSON, emit('snapshot', data)

  U->>U: renderStatus() → danger chip live<br/>renderTicker() → alerts crawl<br/>initMap() → 4,887 station markers

  U->>U: T+1.6s: boot div removed,<br/>announceReady() → screen-reader live region

  U->>U: startTap() → SSE /api/tap
  U->>CF: EventSource('/api/tap')
  CF->>FN: proxy /api/tap
  FN->>T: tunnel stream
  T->>M: GET /api/tap
  M-->>T: text/event-stream
  Note over U,M: every new event<br/>renders as a row in real time
